<title>USA: Realty ReFund Trust reduces qtrly dividend.</title>
<headline>Realty ReFund Trust reduces qtrly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND, Ohio 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Realty ReFund Trust said it reduced its quarterly dividend to $0.05 per share from $0.10 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable June 16 to shareholders of record on June 2.</p>
<p>The company said it regularly pays a quarterly dividend, however, it does not pay a regualar amount per dividend.</p>
